            <ArticleTitle>Juvenile X-linked retinoschisis presenting as juxtapapillary retinal fold mimicking combined hamartoma of the retina and retinal pigment epithelium.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>170-172</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
